<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσμαίομαι</span></b> , used by <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only in 
			Ep.
		
		aor. I, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>touch to the
				quick, affect greatly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλα γάρ με θανὼν ἐσεμάσσατο θυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.564
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς ἐμόν γε μάλιστ᾽ ἐσεμάσσατο θυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.425
				</span></i>
			.—The pres.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσμαίομαι</span> is not found, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμαίομαι,
		εἰσματέομαι.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
